<title>UK: London fertiliser fixtures.</title>
<headline>London fertiliser fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>TBN - 15,000 tonnes bulk MAP Kherson/Santos and Rio Grande Aug $23.50 fio basis 1-1 2,000 shex/2,500 shex Comintra.</p>
<p>TBN - 15,000 tonnes bulk fertilisers Constanza/1-2 ports Brazil Aug $20.00 fio basis 1-1 1,500 shex/1,500 shex CNR.</p>
